messages.content:
The API method to clean temporary build artifacts from the Environment Manager is [CONFIRMED]:

POST /api/clean (Port 8200)

1. Request Body (JSON):
{
  "prune_cache": true,
  "remove_orphaned_checkpoints": true
}

2. Response Body (JSON 200 OK):
{
  "status": "success",
  "bytes_freed": 1073741824,
  "purged_files_count": 14
} [CONFIRMED]
